===Etymology===
From {{AGr.}} '''{{polytonic|[[ἀμφίβια]]}}''' (amphibia), nominative plural of '''{{polytonic|[[ἀμφίβιον]]}}''' (amphibion) < '''{{polytonic|[[ἀμφί]]}}''' (amphi) "both" + '''{{polytonic|[[βίος]]}}''' (bios) "life"

